      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THE LAST TRIP (4) has won all four starts since joining Emma Stewart for this campaign, drawing wider and working before scoring by 5m at Melton last time. Tackles some handy ones here but can take advantage of a lower draw. CIGANO (8) resumes after winning both outings last time in. Draws for a trail and is five from five when fresh so expect he'll be ready to fire again. SAO PAULO SIMBA (9) has had a month off since pulling up lame last start but had put together four straight wins at Menangle prior. Draws on the back row but he is a talent. FORTY LOVE (3) worked when close-up at Melton last start and was a class above at Mildura prior. Draws well and hasn't missed a place in seven tries at this distance, winning four. STORMS COLLIDE (7) draws wide but has come from similar barriers to place in both outings off a spell.",
